    "faq": {
      "type": "section",
      "name": "Frequently asked questions",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "center",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground-heading)",
            "wrap": "pretty"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "acc": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plus",
            "dividers": false,
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true
          },
          "blocks": {
            "q1": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Wanneer ontvang ik mijn bestelling?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q1_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Zodra je bestelling is verzonden, ontvang je een e-mail met je trackinglink, zodat je je pakket bij elke stap kunt volgen. Alle details vind je in ons <a href=\"/pages/verzendbeleid\">verzendbeleid</a>.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "wrap": "pretty"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q1_t"
              ]
            },
            "q2": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Wat kost de verzending?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q2_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Niets: verzending is bij Lovaire altijd gratis.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "wrap": "pretty"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q2_t"
              ]
            },
            "q3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Kan ik mijn bestelling retourneren?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q3_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Je kunt ongeopende producten binnen 30 dagen na ontvangst retourneren. Voor hygiëneproducten zoals cosmetica en ondergoed gelden aparte voorwaarden. Lees alles op onze pagina <a href=\"/pages/bestellingen-en-levering-1\">ruilen en retourneren</a>.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "wrap": "pretty"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q3_t"
              ]
            },
            "q4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Waar worden jullie producten gemaakt?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q4_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Onze producten worden zowel lokaal als wereldwijd gemaakt. We kiezen onze productiepartners zorgvuldig, zodat jij kwaliteit krijgt voor een eerlijke prijs.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "wrap": "pretty"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q4_t"
              ]
            },
            "q5": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Ik heb een vraag, hoe bereik ik jullie?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q5_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Stuur ons een bericht via onze <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contactpagina</a>. Onze Nederlandse klantenservice is 24/7 voor je bereikbaar.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "wrap": "pretty"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q5_t"
              ]
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "q1",
            "q2",
            "q3",
            "q4",
            "q5"
          ]
        }
